---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LinkButton from '../components/LinkButton.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- SECTION 1: Hero -->
  <section class="pt-10 px-6 pb-8 text-center">
    <div class="w-[130px] h-[130px] bg-blue-soft rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 overflow-hidden p-4">
      <img src="/logo.png" alt="Empowr CIC" class="w-full h-full object-contain" decoding="async" />
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-serif text-[42px] font-bold text-text mb-1">Empowr CIC</h1>
    <p class="text-[15px] text-gray mb-4">@empowr.cic</p>

    <div class="text-[22px] font-black leading-[1.4] mb-5">
      <span class="block sm:inline text-red">Live by growing.</span>
      <span class="block sm:inline text-blue">Grow by learning.</span>
      <span class="block sm:inline">Learn by doing.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-soft rounded-full px-[18px] py-2 text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[1px] text-text mb-6">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-blue rounded-full shrink-0"></span>
      EMPOWERING THE COMMUNITY, TRUSTED BY MANY
    </div>

    <p class="text-[17px] leading-[1.6] text-text mb-6">
      At Empowr, we don't just talk about wellbeing — we build it. Through hands-on experiences that strengthen body and mind, we're proving that experiential learning isn't just beneficial, it's essential to a healthier, more capable society.
    </p>

    <p class="text-base font-bold text-blue mb-2">Not sure which skate session to pick?</p>
    <p class="text-[15px] text-text mb-5">Take our <strong class="font-extrabold">2-minute quiz</strong> to find out which session will be best for you?</p>

    <a href="/quiz" class="block w-full bg-blue text-white text-[18px] font-extrabold py-[18px] px-6 rounded-[14px] no-underline transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 text-center">
      ✨ Discover Your Next Session 🛼
    </a>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-7">
      <div class="bg-blue-pale rounded-[14px] py-4 px-1 text-center overflow-hidden">
        <span class="text-2xl font-black text-blue block">25K+</span>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-text mt-0.5">ATTENDANCES</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-blue-pale rounded-[14px] py-4 px-1 text-center overflow-hidden">
        <span class="text-2xl font-black text-blue block">10K+</span>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-text mt-0.5">STUDENTS</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-blue-pale rounded-[14px] py-4 px-1 text-center overflow-hidden">
        <span class="text-2xl font-black text-blue block">5+</span>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-text mt-0.5">LOCATIONS</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2: Quick Links + Kids -->
  <div class="h-px bg-divider mx-6 my-2"></div>

  <div class="h-5"></div>

  <div class="px-6 pb-7 flex flex-col gap-3">
    <LinkButton href="https://www.empowrcic.org/sk8-skool" variant="dark"  icon="🛼" label="Sk8 skool (15+)" />
    <LinkButton href="https://www.empowrcic.org/shop" variant="pale"  icon="🛒" label="Empowr shop" />
    <LinkButton href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/EFSwGLtxaYLHCKcA2j4k6k" variant="green" icon="💬" label="WhatsApp notification" />
  </div>

  <div class="h-px bg-divider mx-6 my-2"></div>
  <div class="h-5"></div>

  <div class="mx-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/assets/kidz.jpeg" alt="Kidz roller skating classes" class="w-full h-[260px] object-cover object-top block" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </div>

  <div class="h-4"></div>

  <div class="px-6 pb-7">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-blue-card-badge rounded-full px-[14px] py-1.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[1px] text-text mb-3.5">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-blue rounded-full shrink-0"></span>
      AGES 5 YEARS – 15 YEARS
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-text mb-2.5">Roller Skating For Children</h2>
    <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-text mb-[18px]">
      Kidz Space – we host <strong class="font-extrabold">roller skating classes</strong> for children and families,
      <strong class="font-extrabold">roller camps, roller discos,</strong> and <strong class="font-extrabold">so much more!</strong>
    </p>
    <a href="https://www.empowrcic.org/kidzspace" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block text-[15px] font-extrabold text-blue no-underline">Open kidz space ~&gt;</a>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 3: Adults + Trusted By -->
  <div class="bg-blue-card mx-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/assets/adults-learning.jpeg" alt="Adults learning roller skating" class="w-full h-[220px] object-cover block" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <div class="px-[22px] pt-[22px] pb-7 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[1.5px] text-white mb-3 uppercase">
        THROUGH HANDS-ON EXPERIENCES THAT STRENGTHEN BODY AND MIND.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4"># Learning as Adults (15+)</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-white/[0.92] mb-[22px]">
        We offer Sk8 Skool courses tailored for beginners and those looking to improve. Join us for weekly,
        beginner-friendly roller dance sessions called SYNKRON8, along with inclusive skate jam sessions for
        the community, and so much more!
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.empowrcic.org/sk8-skool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full bg-white text-text text-sm font-black tracking-[1px] py-4 px-6 rounded-xl no-underline text-center uppercase transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
        FIND YOUR SESSION 🛼
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="py-8 px-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[2px] text-gray uppercase mb-5">TRUSTED BY:</p>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 flex-wrap">
      <img src="/assets/lewisham-logo.jpeg" alt="Lewisham" class="h-[50px] w-auto object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="/assets/dfe.jpeg" alt="Department for Education" class="h-[50px] w-auto object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img src="/assets/young-mayor.jpeg" alt="Young Mayor of Lewisham" class="h-[50px] w-auto object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 4: Trustpilot Review + Donate -->
  <div class="h-px bg-divider mx-6 my-2"></div>

  <div class="py-7 px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 mb-4">
      <div class="w-[52px] h-[52px] bg-[#f5f5e8] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">⭐</div>
      <div>
        <a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/empowrcic.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline">
          <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black tracking-[0.5px] uppercase hover:underline">Review about us from Trustpilot</h3>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray mt-0.5">Rated excellent by our members</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base font-black mb-2"><u>Brilliant</u>!</p>
    <p class="text-sm leading-[1.7] text-text">
      "I only take the time to write a review if something is exceptionally good or horrendously bad.<br /><br />
      These classes are BRILLIANT! Instructors are knowledgeable, patient and approachable which made for a
      comfortable, unpressured learning environment. On top of this they are extremely attentive whilst providing
      instruction and especially when you fall.<br /><br />
      There were many returning students, which speaks for itself.<br /><br />
      Highly recommend for all ages."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="h-px bg-divider mx-6 my-2"></div>

  <div class="bg-blue-card mt-2 mx-6 mb-7 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/assets/heroes.jpeg" alt="Empowr Heroes community" class="w-full h-[220px] object-cover block" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <div class="px-[22px] pt-[22px] pb-7 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-white mb-3.5">
        <span class="text-[#FFD700]">REAL CHANGE</span> STARTS HERE
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-[1.7] text-white/[0.92] mb-[22px]">
        Your contributions support Empowr's mission of lifelong well-being through experiential learning.
        You're about to support something powerful—action-based healing in real communities.
      </p>
      <a href="https://hero.empowrcic.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full bg-white text-text text-sm font-black tracking-[1px] py-4 px-6 rounded-xl no-underline text-center uppercase transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
        🏆 BECOME A HERO TODAY ~&gt;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="h-px bg-divider mx-6 my-2"></div>

  <!-- SECTION 5: Get Involved -->
  <div class="h-6"></div>
  <div class="px-6 pb-12 flex flex-col gap-3">
    <LinkButton href="mailto:general@empowrcic.org" variant="pale" icon="🙋" label="Volunteering" />
    <LinkButton href="https://www.empowrcic.org/b4e" variant="dark" icon="🛼" label="Donating Skates" />
    <LinkButton href="mailto:general@empowrcic.org" variant="pale" icon="🤝" label="Collaboration" />
    <LinkButton href="mailto:general@empowrcic.org" variant="dark" icon="✉️" label="General enquiries" />
  </div>
</Layout>
